# ── The Verity Site Dossier — environment ──────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. NEVER commit real values.

# SEC EDGAR requires a descriptive User-Agent (name + contact email) on EVERY
# request. A missing or weak User-Agent returns HTTP 403. Use a real contact.
SEC_USER_AGENT="Terra Verity Ledger admin@example.com"

# Optional. Server-side only — powers the AI's three grounded jobs
# (entity-match reranking, record summarization, memo drafting). If unset, the
# app uses deterministic fallbacks (string-similarity matching + templated memo).
# The AI NEVER generates facts; it only operates on fetched records.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""
# Model for the AI layer. Default claude-opus-4-8.
VERITY_MODEL="claude-opus-4-8"

# Dev/testing only. "1" serves clearly-labeled SAMPLE records so the full
# pipeline is demonstrable without live .gov access. Leave UNSET / "0" for
# production — in production the app only shows live records or explicit
# "no record" / "source unreachable" states. Never a silent fabricated fallback.
VERITY_SAMPLE_DATA="0"
